{
  "_comment": [
    "Notable ambience (.product/specs/notable-ambience.md): the beat pool, the walking notables' tags, preferred beats, optional companions and authored relationships. ambience.py validates this and emits the ROM tables into src/data/wayfarer_world/tables.h. Waits and cooldowns are in ticks of 15 frames; every number is a placeholder for playtesting.",
    "trainers: one entry per simulated trainer (routines.json simulated: true), by catalog slug. tags: 1 to 3 of athletic, cheerful, curious, dreamy, mystic, elegant, water, elder, nimble, cocky, stoic. preferred (optional): a beat id listed twice at the pick; the trainer must qualify for it. companion (optional): a species (SPECIES_* name without the prefix) shown before the roster's aces; it needs an overworld follower sprite.",
    "relationships: authored pairs, family or friend; they win over the derived rival (any two Champions) and colleague (Gym Leaders of one region; the Elite Four and Champion of one League) relations.",
    "beats: in pool order (the order the pick lists them in). class: idle, transition or react. when: terms that must all hold: walking, dwelling, arriving, leaving, blocked, outdoors, companion_room, {facing: water|grass|npc|counter}, {spot: [kinds or named:<activity>]} (implies dwelling), {spot_not: [kinds]} (dwelling, at none of these), {activity: [activities]}, {player_within: n}, {player_adjacent_ticks: n}, {notable_within: n, relation: family|friend|rival|colleague (optional, else any walker)}, {any: [terms]} (at least one holds). who (optional): tags_any, tags_none, companion: true. flags (optional): keep_walking, once_per_approach, once_per_pair, once_per_episode. cooldown (optional, default 80).",
    "steps (1 to 8): face <down|up|left|right|player|other|target|away|companion>, look_back, wait <ticks>, step <ahead|back|left|right>, jump, spin, bow nurse, turn npc, emote <icon>, emote <even>/<odd> (by beat counter parity), effect <ripple|splash|grass_shake|dust|sparkle> <ahead|own>, companion out, companion in, companion_do <face|jump>. Icons: ! !! ? X heart … (or ...) happy music love curious pensive sad angry surprise. step ahead walks the facing, left and right walk west and east, back undoes the last unreturned step (or steps backwards); a beat stays within 1 tile of its start and ends on it. A beat with a companion out step needs a companion."
  ],
  "trainers": {
